Doctor: Seeing him like this it just makes me realize I love you Deanndra.

6
00:00:25,300 --> 00:00:29,400
主任:好,停!!道具!!
Director: And cut!!Craps!!

7
00:00:29,400 --> 00:00:31,500
迈克:阿蒂!阿蒂!觉得我怎样?
Mike: Artie!Artie!What'd you think?

8
00:00:32,240 --> 00:00:33,700
阿蒂:我又笑又哭,你演的太好了.
Artie: I laughed, I cried, you're on at 5.

9
00:00:34,100 --> 00:00:35,700
迈克:谢谢.
Mike: Thanks.

10
00:00:35,700 --> 00:00:36,700
凯特:嘿!
Kate: Hi!

11
00:00:36,700 --> 00:00:37,200
迈克:凯特!!
Mike: Kate!!

12
00:00:37,200 --> 00:00:37,800
凯特:你太棒了!
Kate: You were wonderful!

13
00:00:38,660 --> 00:00:39,400
迈克:哦,
Mike: Oh thank you,

14
00:00:39,420 --> 00:00:42,160
谢谢.你知道我真的要进入到那种昏迷的状态了.
you know I'm really getting into this coma stuff and I think people are

15
00:00:42,160 --> 00:00:42,300
我想人们一定会留意到我的.
really starting to notice.

16
00:00:42,300 --> 00:00:44,700
柴肯先生:今年昏迷的不错,西沃.
Mr.Checken: Nice coma today Seaver.

17
00:00:45,480 --> 00:00:48,100
迈克:谢谢,柴肯先生.你能认可意义重大啊.
Mike: Thank you Mr.Checken, that means a lot coming from you.

18
00:00:48,100 --> 00:00:52,200
莱奈特:卡斯塔尔佛莱克曼,首席作家,很荣幸.
Lennette: Castille Flackman, head writer, it is a pleasure.

19
00:00:53,220 --> 00:00:55,640
迈克:每周我都能在片头看到你的名字.哇!
Mike: I see your name on the credits every week.Wow!

20
00:00:56,300 --> 00:00:58,160
柴肯先生:亲爱的,你去给我倒杯咖啡,
Mr.Checken: Sweetheart you want to get me a cup of coffee and rip the

21
00:00:58,160 --> 00:00:58,900
再加块松饼.
top off a muffin.

22
00:01:00,420 --> 00:01:01,400
凯特:让我去干什么!?
Kate: Do I want to what!?

23
00:01:01,400 --> 00:01:08,600
迈克:很抱歉,亲爱的,我想他是想单独跟我谈谈.就这一次.
Mike: Excuse me, honey I think he wants to talk to me alone.Just this once.

24
00:01:09,460 --> 00:01:11,780
莱奈特:你的表演太精彩了.
Lennette: We've been so impressed with your performance,

25
00:01:12,000 --> 00:01:13,680
你就是斯特劳夫维沃利,
you are Straughn Waverly,

26
00:01:14,400 --> 00:01:17,000
你把握住了人物的实质和内心.
the way you have explored textures and the internal harmonics.

27
00:01:17,760 --> 00:01:21,240
柴肯先生:对,就是!同感!为了你,你一定要保密.
Mr.Checken: Yeah Right!Ditto!I hope for your sake you can keep a secret.

28
00:01:21,880 --> 00:01:23,420
迈克:是,是,保什么密?
Mike: Yeah Yeah, what's this?

29
00:01:23,420 --> 00:01:25,860
莱奈特:这段情节全美国都在期待.
Lennette: The episode America's been waiting for

30
00:05:07,000 --> 00:05:10,900
迈克:开萝尔!开萝尔!你来听我背台词,再说说你的看法.
Mike: Carol!Carol!I need you to watch me do my line and tell me what you think.

31
00:05:10,900 --> 00:05:12,500
开萝尔:迈克!别烦我.
Carol: Mike!Leave me alone.

32
00:05:12,500 --> 00:05:14,500
迈克:如果挣够了钱,我就搬出去.
Mike: If I make enough money, I'll move out.

33
00:05:14,500 --> 00:05:17,600
开萝尔:我听着呢,快点吧.
Carol: I'm all ears.Just make it fast.

34
00:05:17,600 --> 00:05:20,200
迈克:好的,我给你介绍一下背景.
Mike: Ok, let me give you some background.

35
00:05:20,200 --> 00:05:28,700
时间是1974年,绿谷的族长泰勒帕尔莫兰斯剥夺了三个儿子-福斯科,科里根和默瑞的继承权.
Now in 1974, Taylor Palmerance, the patriarch of Green Valley disinherited his 3 sons, Frisco, Corrigan, and Murray.

36
00:05:28,700 --> 00:05:43,600
开萝尔:他们三个知道你的台词吗?
Carol: Do any of them know your line?

37
00:05:43,600 --> 00:05:45,600
迈克:这不是我的台词,我在清嗓子呢.
Mike: That's not my line, I'm getting prepared.

38
00:05:45,600 --> 00:05:50,900
开萝尔:迈克!!
Carol: Mike!!

39
00:05:50,900 --> 00:05:58,200
迈克:克鲁兹班尼斯特.呃!!??
Mike: Cruz Bannister.Well!!??

40
00:05:58,200 --> 00:06:01,000
开萝尔:什么啊!?你躺在那里打嗝呢.
Carol: Well what!??You laid there and belched.

41
00:06:01,000 --> 00:06:14,800
迈克:不,不是的,开萝尔,这是凶手的名字.不过,你说的对,我要念的更好点.克鲁兹班尼斯特!!呃?
Mike: No no no, Carol that was the name of the murderer.But you're right I can do much better than that.Cruz Bannister!!Well?

42
00:06:14,800 --> 00:06:19,000
开萝尔:这样他们还付你钱吗!!?一只浮游生物都比你强.
Carol: They pay you for this!!??A speck of protoplasm could do better.

43
00:06:19,000 --> 00:06:26,600
迈克:好的,你说的对,说的对.我再想想.他还带着呼吸器呢.克鲁兹班尼斯特.
Mike: Ok, you're right, you're right.What was I thinking?You're still on the respirator.Cruz Bannister.

44
00:06:26,600 --> 00:06:39,400
玛丽亚:你好,陌生人.
Maria: Howdy stranger!?

45
00:06:39,400 --> 00:06:46,500
开萝尔:哦,住嘴!布兰,我把你当成一个人向你请求帮助.
Carol: Oh Shut up!Bran, let me appeal to you as a human being.

46
00:06:46,500 --> 00:06:48,200
布兰:说吧!
Bran: Cool.

47
00:06:48,200 --> 00:07:07,600
开萝尔:你看我的学习成绩下滑了,我在家里学不进去,因为我哥哥老在排练那部烂肥皂剧的台词.我在这里也不行,因为你是个迟钝的笨蛋.我的学习成绩受到很大的影响,
Carol: You see I'm falling behind in my studies, I can't study at home because my brother keeps rehearsing his stupid soap opera line and I can't study here because like you're an insensitive boob, and my academic performance is suffering.

48
00:07:07,600 --> 00:07:13,700
我受够了.我希望你能给我一点人的同情心.
I am suffering, and all I am asking from you is a little bit of human understanding.

49
00:07:13,700 --> 00:07:23,000
布兰:开萝尔你从没提起过.你哥哥上肥皂剧了!??哪一部?演哪个角色!!??
Bran: Carol you have never mentioned this before, your brother is on a soap opera!??Which one, who does he play!!??

50
00:07:23,000 --> 00:07:25,800
开萝尔:我不知道,也不关心.他只是半死不活地躺在那里.
Carol: I don't know, I don't care, he just lies there and breathes.

51
00:07:25,800 --> 00:07:30,600
布兰:啊!!我室友的哥哥是斯特劳夫维沃利三世.
Bran: Ah!!My roommates brother is Straughn Waverly the third.

52
00:07:30,600 --> 00:07:31,900
学生:谁哥哥!??
Students: Who's brother!??

53
00:07:31,900 --> 00:07:33,800
布兰:开萝尔,我的室友.
Bran: Carol, my roommate.

54
00:07:33,800 --> 00:07:38,100
学生:我不知道你还有个室友!
Student: I didn't know you had a roommate!

55
00:07:38,100 --> 00:08:05,000
布兰:小姐们,开萝尔西沃!
Bran: Girls, Carol Seaver

56
00:08:05,000 --> 00:08:08,000
学生:我们怎么知道你哥哥演斯特劳夫维沃利!??
Student: How do we really know that you brother is Straughn Waverly!??

57
00:08:08,000 --> 00:08:10,400
学生:对啊!!??
Student: Yeah!!??

58
00:08:10,400 --> 00:08:23,200
开萝尔:如果他不演的话,我怎么自动化那个凶手的名字叫克鲁兹班尼斯特.
Carol: Well, If he weren't on the show, how would I know the name of the murder is Cruz Bannister.

59
00:08:23,200 --> 00:08:29,400
布兰:克鲁兹班尼斯特!!??凶手是克鲁兹班尼斯特!!??这就对了!啊.
Bran: Cruz Bannister!!??The murder is Cruz Bannister!!??That's it!AH.

60
00:08:29,400 --> 00:08:33,400
学生:开萝尔,你能带我们去看看吗?
Student: Carol do you think you can take us to see the show?

61
00:08:33,400 --> 00:08:34,800
开萝尔:嘿,我可是他的指导老师啊.
Carol: Hey, I'm his acting coach.

62
00:08:34,800 --> 00:08:41,000
学生:太好了!!!
Students: Alright!!!

63
00:08:41,000 --> 00:08:42,800
卢克:看,手到病除.
Luke: There, I almost got it.

64
00:08:42,800 --> 00:08:45,600
克莉丝:你在哪里学会修布娃娃的的?
Chrissy: Where did you learn so much about fixing dolls?

65
00:08:45,600 --> 00:08:48,100
卢克:我在一家布娃娃医院当过医生.
Luke: I was a surgeon at a doll hospital.

66
00:08:48,100 --> 00:08:49,400
克莉丝:你没有!
Chrissy: You were not!

67
00:08:49,400 --> 00:08:55,100
卢克:哦,是吗!!??当"饶舌的凯西"失声后,是谁让她重新开口说话的?
Luke: Oh yeah!!??When chatty Kathy lost her voice, who do you think got her talking again?

68
00:08:55,100 --> 00:09:01,200
当"贝特希维特希"干的像撒哈拉沙漠一样时,是谁打开了水闸?
When Betsy Wetsy dried up like the Sahara, who do you think opened up the flood gates?

69
00:09:01,200 --> 00:09:12,500
当"我的小马"走失了以后,是谁把它找回来的?修好了,就像新的一样.
And when My Little Pony got the trots, who do you think got her back on track?Let's see well it's as good as new.

70
00:09:12,500 --> 00:09:18,700
克莉丝:谢谢卢克.我长大后,你最好小心点!
Chrissy: Thanks Luke, when I'm all grown up you better watch out!

71
00:09:18,700 --> 00:09:23,200
迈克:嘿,卢克!你穿本的小西装干什么?
Mike: Hey Luke!What are you doing dressed up in Ben's weeny suit?

72
00:09:23,200 --> 00:09:25,500
卢克:我想给金姆拜尔一家人留下好印象.
Luke: I want to make a good impression on the Kimbell's.

73
00:09:25,500 --> 00:09:36,300
迈克:所以你就把自己弄的像本?他们不会喜欢你这个样子的,这可不行.上楼去,换一套牛仔.
Mike: So you are dressing like Ben?These people don't like you the way you are, then the heck with them.Go upstairs throw on some jeans.

74
00:09:36,300 --> 00:10:40,900
开萝尔:迈克.
Carol: Mike.

75
00:10:40,900 --> 00:10:43,600
凯特:哇!这个化装间可真大.
Kate: Whoa!This dressing room is huge.

76
00:10:43,600 --> 00:10:51,900
迈克:凯特,看见了吗!!?我的沙发,我的废纸蒌;再看这个,写有我名字的椅子.
Mike: Kate, look at this!!?My sofa, my waste paper basket, and look at this my chair with my name on it.

77
00:10:51,900 --> 00:10:53,500
凯特:马克西沃??
Kate.Mark Seaver??

78
00:10:53,500 --> 00:10:58,800
迈克:不能什么都要,哈哈.格伦!!还记得我女朋友吗?
Mike: Can't have everything haha.Glen!!You remember my girlfriend?

79
00:10:58,800 --> 00:11:00,200
格伦:当然!有坏消息.
Glen: Can it!Bad news.

80
00:11:00,200 --> 00:11:05,000
莱奈特:斯特劳夫,斯特劳夫,我们改编了有关你的整个的情节.
Lennete: Straughn Straughn, we've re-written your whole scene.

81
00:11:05,000 --> 00:11:07,300
迈克:开玩笑吧!?我还醒过来吗?
Mike: You're kidding!?Do I still wake up?

82
00:11:07,300 --> 00:11:13,700
莱奈特:当然了.不过你不再说克鲁兹班尼斯特了,你改说"布鲁克桑德费尔德".
Lennette: Of course, but you don't say Cruz Bannister anymore, now you say Brook Sunderfield.

83
00:11:13,700 --> 00:11:15,900
迈克:他是凶手?
Mike: He's the murderer?

84
00:11:15,900 --> 00:11:18,700
莱奈特:女的.
Lennette: She.

85
00:11:18,700 --> 00:11:26,800
迈克:哇!太以外了!!呃…布鲁克桑德费尔德…这样行吗?
Mike: Wow!This is a curveball!Uhh..Brook Sunderfield...Is that ok?

86
00:11:26,800 --> 00:11:32,900
格伦:这孩子是个警察还是什么!!??吹一下,我帮你拨拨鼻毛.
Glen: Is this kid a trooper or what!!??Blow it and I yank out you nose hair!

87
00:11:32,900 --> 00:11:34,700
迈克:呃,你为什么把那个凶手的名字改了?
Mike: Uhh, why did you change the name of the murderer?

88
00:11:34,700 --> 00:11:40,800
莱奈特:我们中间出了个叛徒,把克鲁兹班尼斯特这个名字透漏给哥伦比亚大学校报了.
Lennette: Some serpent in our midst gave the name Cruz Bannister to the Columbia University paper.

89
00:11:40,800 --> 00:11:44,500
格伦:我越想这事就越想把那个内奸给宰了.
Glen: The more I think about it, the more I would like to pop the weasel that did it.

90
00:11:44,500 --> 00:11:47,000
迈克:哦,真该杀.
Mike: Ohh, kids today.

91
00:11:47,000 --> 00:11:49,500
莱奈特:斯特劳夫,该换服装了,5分钟后开拍.
Lennette: Straughn, better get into wardrobe, roll tape in five minutes.

92
00:11:49,500 --> 00:11:52,500
迈克:好的,知道了.
Mike: Ok, right.

93
00:11:52,500 --> 00:11:54,400
格伦:你需要什么就告诉我.
Glen: You need anything, you let me know.

94
00:11:54,400 --> 00:11:56,500
迈克:好,还没什么事.
Mike: Ok, I can't think of a thing.

95
00:11:56,500 --> 00:12:01,400
凯特:哦,我有.也许是件小事,但俄尼在这个椅子上打了记号.
Kate: Oh I can, this may seem petty but Ernie put mark on the chair.

96
00:12:01,400 --> 00:12:04,600
格伦:别说了.那是以前的事了,他被开除了!!
Glen: Say no more, Ernie's history.He's fired!!

97
00:12:04,600 --> 00:12:09,100
迈克:不,不要.只要把椅子上的名字改了就行,不要开除谁.
Mike: No no, just maybe change the name on the chair, don't fire anybody.

98
00:12:09,100 --> 00:12:17,400
格伦:哦,好的…
Glen: Well, ok...

99
00:12:17,400 --> 00:12:18,400
迈克:如何??
Mike: Well??

100
00:12:18,400 --> 00:12:26,000
凯特:抱歉,像个圆面包.
Kate: Ill, sorry looking buns,

101
00:12:26,000 --> 00:12:28,200
迈克:喂?我是斯特劳夫维沃利三世.
Mike: Hello?Straughn Waverly the third.

102
00:12:28,200 --> 00:12:30,000
卢克:你好,迈克西沃在吗?
Luke: Yeah, hello is Mike Seaver there?

103
00:12:30,000 --> 00:12:34,900
迈克:你好,卢克,我是迈克.我进入角色了.什么事?
Mike: Yeah, Luke, it's me Mike.I was just getting into character, what's up?

104
00:12:34,900 --> 00:12:39,600
卢克:你一直对我很够哥们,我觉得应该跟你告个别.
Luke: Look you've been straight with me, felt I owed you a goodbye.

105
00:12:39,600 --> 00:12:43,000
迈克:告别.嘿,听着,兄弟,你不过穿城而过罢了.
Mike: A goodbye, hey listen pal you're just moving across town.

106
00:12:43,000 --> 00:12:44,300
卢克:我要离开这里了.
Luke: I'm leaving town,.

107
00:12:44,300 --> 00:12:45,700
迈克:卢克,你去哪里啊!?
Mike: Luke, where are you going!?

108
00:12:45,700 --> 00:12:48,300
卢克:我要到佛罗里达过冬,别担心,我会好的.
Luke: I'll spend the winter in Florida, don't worry I'll be fine.

109
00:12:48,300 --> 00:12:52,700
车站广播员:旅客们,现在开始登车…
Announcer: Sorry for the interruption, all buses will be boarding....

110
00:12:52,700 --> 00:12:53,900
迈克:卢克,别走.
Mike: Luke don't do this!

111
00:12:53,900 --> 00:12:56,500
卢克:我会来看你的.
Luke: I'll look you up someday.

112
00:12:56,500 --> 00:13:00,400
迈克:卢克!
Mike: Luke!

113
00:13:00,400 --> 00:13:01,000
凯特:什么事!?
Kate: What's wrong!?

114
00:13:01,000 --> 00:13:04,600
迈克:凯特,给汽车站打电话,问问去佛罗里达的下一班车什么时候开.
Mike: Kate, call the bus station, find out the next bus that leaves anywhere for Florida.

115
00:13:04,600 --> 00:13:07,600
凯特:迈克,我知道你今天很紧张,但逃跑不能解决问题.
Kate: Mike, I know you are nervous about today, but running away isn't the answer.

116
00:13:07,600 --> 00:13:15,200
迈克:不是,凯特!我不是我逃跑,是卢克.
Mike: No Kate!I'm not running, Luke is.

117
00:13:15,200 --> 00:13:17,200
阿蒂:还有5分钟,西沃先生.
Artie: 5 minutes Mr.Seaver.

118
00:13:17,200 --> 00:13:19,000
迈克:告诉格伦,我有事.
Mike: Get Glen on that I got a problem.

119
00:13:19,000 --> 00:13:23,400
阿蒂:格伦,这孩子有事!!
Artie: Glen, the kid's got a problem!!

120
00:13:23,400 --> 00:13:26,300
莱奈特:斯特劳夫,为什么还不换装!?
Lennette: Straughn, why aren't you in wardrobe!?

121
00:13:26,300 --> 00:13:28,500
迈克:我们能不能把这一场推到明天拍呢?
Mike: Look is there anyway we can put this off till tomorrow?

122
00:13:28,500 --> 00:13:33,000
莱奈特:不可能!明天你要赤裸上身带着特警搜索凶手的住处.
Lennette: Impossible!Tomorrow you lead the SWAT team to the murderer's lair with your shirt off.

123
00:13:33,000 --> 00:13:35,100
迈克:也许我们可以推迟一两个小时.
Mike: Maybe we can just delay it for an hour or two.

124
00:13:35,100 --> 00:13:39,200
格伦:今晚的拍摄决不能推迟!!做个男人,勇敢点!!
Glen: Entertainment tonight is here for crying out loud!!Be a man!!

125
00:13:39,200 --> 00:13:44,200
迈克:听我解释,有个孩子和我们住在一起,他马上就要离开重新去过那种流浪生活了.我是唯一可以阻止他的人.
Mike: Look there's this boy that's been living with our family and he's about to run back down to the streets and I am the only one who can stop him.

126
00:13:44,200 --> 00:13:47,000
格伦:今晚的拍摄!
Glen: Entertainment Tonight!

127
00:13:47,000 --> 00:13:49,300
凯特:20分钟后有辆巴士去福特劳德代尔.
Kate: There's a bus to Fort Lauderdale in 20 minutes.

128
00:13:49,300 --> 00:13:51,300
迈克:好!好!我会尽快赶回来.
Mike: Ok!Ok!So I can be back in..

129
00:13:51,300 --> 00:13:57,500
莱奈特:等等.这个孩子一直在你家,而在这个节骨眼上,你的心还在他身上.这太好了.
Lennette: Wait a minute, so this boy has been in your home and now at the moment of truth your heart goes out to him.It's wonderful.

130
00:13:57,500 --> 00:13:58,500
迈克:那我可以走吗??
Mike: So can I go!??

131
00:13:58,500 --> 00:14:03,300
莱奈特:不!!但你这个故事可以吸引小孩子.
Lennette: No!!But that storyline screams daytime nanny.

132
00:14:03,300 --> 00:14:04,300
凯特:你就不能让他走!!?
Kate: Can't you just let him go!!?

133
00:14:04,300 --> 00:14:06,200
格伦:她是个名角!?
Glen: Is she anybody!?

134
00:14:06,200 --> 00:14:07,500
莱奈特:不!!
Lennette: No!!

135
00:14:07,500 --> 00:14:09,900
格伦:这场戏5分钟后开拍,躺到那张床上去!!
Glen: This scene shoots in 5 minutes with you in that bed!!

136
00:14:09,900 --> 00:14:14,800
莱奈特:斯特劳夫,我围绕着你编写了整个故事情节,这可是一生难得的机遇.
Lennette:  Straughn I have designed whole storylines around you, this is a once in a lifetime opportunity.

137
00:14:14,800 --> 00:14:22,900
迈克:我知道,我理解.我有个主意.今天我们就在床上放个假人,明天我回来演那场特警的戏,你看怎么样?
Mike: I know, I understand.Look I have an idea, what about if we put a dummy in the bed today and tomorrow I'll come back and do the shirtless SWAT thing.

138
00:14:22,900 --> 00:14:28,500
格伦:你看怎么样?没有斯特劳夫了!你被开除了!!!
Glen: How about this?No more Straughn!You're fired!!!

139
00:14:28,500 --> 00:14:29,300
迈克:你当真!?
Mike: Are you serious!?

140
00:14:29,300 --> 00:14:38,500
格伦:就这么简单,留下或开除,走就开除,你敢走出一步,就别想再回来.
Glen: It's so simple, stay not fired, leave fired, history, out of here deep sixed.

141
00:14:38,500 --> 00:14:40,600
迈克:我走.
Mike: I got to go.

142
00:14:40,600 --> 00:14:44,500
格伦:那好,门在那里…你被开了!!!
Glen: Well, there's the door..You're fired!!!

143
00:14:44,500 --> 00:14:55,300
不,哦,不,你不明白吗?其他人被开除后会痛哭流涕,拜倒在我的脚下哀求我再用他们.你被开了!!!
No no no, you wouldn't understand people cry and throw themselves at my feet and beg me to hire them back when they're fired and you're fired!!!

144
00:14:55,300 --> 00:14:55,900
迈克:听见了.
Mike: I heard you.

145
00:14:55,900 --> 00:15:00,500
格伦:听着,我情绪失控,你没被开除,我们另想办法.
Glen: Listen I lost my head, you're not fired, we'll work something out.

146
00:15:00,500 --> 00:15:01,000
迈克:谢谢.
Mike: Thanks.

147
00:15:01,000 --> 00:15:08,600
格伦:现在你想重新为我干活了…你被开了!!!乒!乓!梆!滚出去!真不顺利,我很不爽.
Glen: And now that you are working for me again... You're fired!!!Bing!!Bam!Boom!You're out!Something's wrong, I'm not enjoying it.

148
00:15:08,600 --> 00:15:10,800
莱奈特:原谅他吧,他根本不配演斯特劳夫.
Lennette: Forget him, he's obviously not Straughn.

149
00:15:10,800 --> 00:15:25,400
格伦:当然不配,因为他被开了!!他甚至不存在了.实际上,我都不知道在跟谁说话呢.这里没人,我跟空气说话呢.
Glen: Of course not because he's fired!!He doesn't even exist, infact I don't even know who I'm talking to.Nobody's there, I'm talking to air.

150
00:15:25,400 --> 00:15:28,400
迈克:呃,凯特,我去找自己的甲克.我会尽快回来.
Mike: Uhh, look Kate I need to find my jacket.I'll be back as soon as I can.

151
00:15:28,400 --> 00:15:42,700
凯特:别担心我,只管去吧.我为你骄傲,迈克西沃.
Kate: Don't worry about me, just go.I'm proud of you Mark Seaver.

152
00:15:42,700 --> 00:15:43,600
阿蒂:要帮忙吗?
Artie: Can I help you?

153
00:15:43,600 --> 00:15:46,700
开萝尔:是的,我在找迈克西沃.
Carol: Yes, I'm looking for Mike Seaver.

154
00:15:46,700 --> 00:15:47,900
阿蒂:没听过这个人.
Artie: Never heard of him.

155
00:15:47,900 --> 00:15:52,300
开萝尔:他就是这个剧组的,我知道,我是他妹妹.
Carol: Well he's on this show, I should know, I'm his sister.

156
00:15:52,300 --> 00:15:58,500
阿蒂:抱歉小姐.这个剧组成立的时候我就跟着了,知道吗?不信你可以去问制片人去.
Artie: Excuse me toots, I've only been with this show since it was created you know?You don't believe me, you go ask the producer there.

157
00:15:58,500 --> 00:16:06,000
格伦:你被开了!!开了!!开了!!不明白!!??
Glen: You're fired!!Fired!!Fired!!Do you understand!!??

158
00:16:06,000 --> 00:16:10,800
开萝尔:嘿,我找迈克西沃.
Carol: Hi, I'm looking for Mike Seaver.

159
00:16:10,800 --> 00:16:18,600
格伦:迈克西沃??这里没有迈克西沃.从没有什么迈克西沃.只有空气!空气!
Glen: Mike Seaver!??There's no Mike Seaver.There never was a Mike Seaver.There's just air!Air!

160
00:16:18,600 --> 00:16:20,900
学生:我又被骗了.
Student: I smell a wookie.

161
00:16:20,900 --> 00:16:28,300
开萝尔:等一下.我有证据.那个凶手的名字在第14页上.布鲁克桑德费尔德!!??
Carol: Wait, I can prove it, the murderer's name is on page 14.Brook Sunderfield!!??

162
00:16:28,300 --> 00:16:30,700
布兰:我就知道克鲁兹办不到的.
Bran: I knew Cruz couldn't have done it.

163
00:16:30,700 --> 00:16:38,200
开萝尔:看,这就是迈克!这就是我的哥哥.
Carol: Wait this is Mike!Look this is my brother.

164
00:16:38,200 --> 00:16:40,900
莱奈特:你们这些孩子在这里干什么?
Lennette: What are your kids doing here?

165
00:16:40,900 --> 00:16:46,100
开萝尔:我们不是孩子,我们是哥伦比亚大学的学生.
Carol: We are not kids, we are students from Columbia University.

166
00:16:46,100 --> 00:16:55,100
莱奈特:保安!!
Lennette: Security!!

167
00:16:55,100 --> 00:17:02,100
迈克:对不起,对不起.
Mike: Excuse me.Excuse me.

168
00:17:02,100 --> 00:17:04,800
卢克:挤什么!
Luke: It's busy!

169
00:17:04,800 --> 00:17:06,400
迈克:卢克!?
Mike: Luke!?

170
00:17:06,400 --> 00:17:07,100
卢克:迈克!!?
Luke: Mike!!?

171
00:17:07,100 --> 00:17:07,600
迈克:嘿.
Mike: Hey.

172
00:17:07,600 --> 00:17:10,800
卢克:你在这里干什么?你应该昏迷着呢.
Luke: What are you doing in here?You're suppose to be in a coma.

173
00:17:10,800 --> 00:17:12,000
迈克:快点,我们下去.
Mike: Come on let's get out of here.

174
00:17:12,000 --> 00:17:14,200
卢克:我不.走了免费座就没了.
Luke: I can't, I'll lose my free seat.

175
00:17:14,200 --> 00:17:17,000
迈克:什么!?你就在厕所里一直待到佛罗里达?
Mike: What!?You're going to ride all the way to Florida in a rest room!?

176
00:17:17,000 --> 00:17:20,000
卢克:总比站在滑板上吊在车后好.
Luke: Beat's hanging on the back of a skateboard.

177
00:17:20,000 --> 00:17:23,200
迈克:得了!得了!我们走!
Mike: Come On!Come on!Let's go!

178
00:17:23,200 --> 00:17:24,500
卢克:让我走吧!!
Luke: Just let me go!!

179
00:17:24,500 --> 00:17:31,500
迈克:我光着上身,带领特警追踪杀人凶手,却让你在街头流浪,我办不到.
Mike: Like I'm going to let you wander the streets while I lead the SWAT team to the killer with my shirt off.

180
00:17:31,500 --> 00:17:36,600
巴士司机:直达福特劳德代尔,请坐好,要不就下车!!
Bus Driver: Fort Lauderdale express, get comfortable or get off!!

181
00:17:36,600 --> 00:17:38,600
迈克:卢克,金姆拜尔一家人有什么不好的?
Mike: Luke, what was wrong with the Kimbell's?

182
00:17:38,600 --> 00:17:45,000
卢克:我不信任一个用棒冰棍收拾一只猫的人.
Luke: I don't trust a man who uses a popsicle stick to fix a cat.

183
00:17:45,000 --> 00:17:47,100
迈克:正经点.金姆拜尔一家人到底有什么不好!!?
Mike: I'm serious, what was wrong with the Kimbell's!!??

184
00:17:47,100 --> 00:17:50,900
卢克:我只是厌烦跟人相处,最后被他们抛弃.
Luke: I'm just getting tired of getting used to people and having them ditch me.

185
00:17:50,900 --> 00:17:52,100
迈克:抛弃你!?
Mike: Ditch you!?

186
00:17:52,100 --> 00:18:03,100
卢克:是的,我爸爸在我两岁时跑了,妈妈也死了,而你们又…
Luke: Yeah, my dad slit when I was 2, my mom died and you guys are...

187
00:18:03,100 --> 00:18:09,800
迈克:我们!??看看你跟我们多融洽啊!!你看,刚一个月你就成为我们家庭的一分子了.
Mike: Us!??Look how great you fit in with us!!?I mean only after a month you were part of our family.

188
00:18:09,800 --> 00:18:14,500
卢克:还不是.
Luke: Not quite.

189
00:18:14,500 --> 00:18:17,100
迈克:司机,把车停下!
Mike: Driver, stop this bus!

190
00:18:17,100 --> 00:18:30,400
巴士司机:快滚下去!
Bus Driver: Blow it out of here!

191
00:18:30,400 --> 00:18:37,100
麦琪:杰森,杰森,我听到楼下有动静,也许卢克回来了.你醒了吗?
Maggie: Jason.Jason.I heard a noise down stairs, maybe Luke's back, are you awake?

192
00:18:37,100 --> 00:18:39,900
迈克:妈妈!爸爸!很抱歉这么晚了,但我已经决定了.
Mike: Mom!Dad!I'm sorry it's so late, but I've made a decision.

193
00:18:39,900 --> 00:18:44,800
我不想让卢克去金姆拜尔家.我想让卢克留在我们家,我会全权照顾他的.
I don't want Luke going to the Kimbell's.I want Luke to stay right here and I will take full responsibility for him.

194
00:18:44,800 --> 00:18:45,600
麦琪:迈克…
Maggie: Mike...

195
00:18:45,600 --> 00:18:48,700
迈克:妈妈!你自己说过的,卢克在这里很融洽.
Mike: Mom!You said it yourself, Luke fits in around here.

196
00:18:48,700 --> 00:18:49,600
麦琪:我是说过的.
Maggie: Well that's true.

197
00:18:49,600 --> 00:18:55,000
迈克:这是因为他爱我们,我们也爱他,这就是我们相处的基础.
Mike: And that's because he loves us and we love him and that' the bottom line.

198
00:18:55,000 --> 00:19:03,100
麦琪:我不否认我心里时时有你这样的想法,杰森.
Maggie: I can't say I haven't had the same thought from time to time.Jason.

199
00:19:03,100 --> 00:19:09,100
杰森:呃…
Jason: Hmmm...

200
00:19:09,100 --> 00:19:12,300
麦琪:那就全票通过了.
Maggie: That makes it unanimous then.

201
00:19:12,300 --> 00:19:13,000
迈克:谢谢妈妈.
Mike: Thanks mom.

202
00:19:13,000 --> 00:19:14,600
麦琪:早上我们再定.
Maggie: We'll work it out in the morning.

203
00:19:14,600 --> 00:19:15,600
迈克:谢谢爸爸.
Mike: Thanks dad.

204
00:19:15,600 --> 00:19:17,400
麦琪:迈克,我和你父亲为你自豪.
Maggie: Mike, your father and I are proud of you.

205
00:19:17,400 --> 00:19:19,500
杰森:呃…
Jason: Hmmm...

206
00:19:19,500 --> 00:19:19,900
迈克:晚安.
Mike: Goodnight.

207
00:19:19,900 --> 00:19:31,500
麦琪:晚安.哦,杰森,这不是很好吗??杰森,杰森!醒醒!
Maggie: Goodnight.Oh Jason isn't this wonderful??Jason.Jason!Wake up!

208
00:19:31,500 --> 00:19:35,000
杰森:出什么事了!!??怎么了?
麦琪:我们刚刚多了个孩子.
00:19:35,000
Jason: What's going on!!??What is it!? Maggie: We just had another child.
